Aim: Develop a simple containerized application using Docker.

Project structure:
student-api/
├── server.js
├── package.json
├── package-lock.json
├── Dockerfile
└── .dockerignore

Program:

1. Dockerfile
FROM node:20-alpine
WORKDIR /app
COPY package*.json ./
RUN npm install
COPY server.js .
EXPOSE 3000
CMD ["node", "server.js"]

2. .dockerignore
node_modules/
.git/
.env

Outputs:
Build the Docker image from the project directory:
Command 1: docker build -t student-api .

Verify the image:
Command 2: docker images

Run the container:
Command 3: docker run -d -p 3000:3000 --name student-api-container student-api

Check the container:
Command 4: docker ps

Test the application at:
Command 5: http://localhost:3000/students

To stop the container:
Command 6: docker stop student-api-container
